0 FILE 6901 - Mobile Lab - Main Model.ldr
0 A Classic Space mobile lab rover with a 6x12 plate chassis, steering wheel, articulated arm assembly, and transparent red and green elements, including hatches, a detector arm, radar dish, cannon, and two astronaut minifigures.
0 Name: 6901 - Mobile Lab - Main Model.ldr
0 Author: Willy Tschager {Holly Wood}
